{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15104640","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104640","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1510464001:1":{"text":"洪水の中でもがく者たちが見えるか、目の前で消えていく命が見えるか……！？","source_cn":"看看那些在洪水中挣扎的人，看看那些逐渐消逝的生命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9DCDE3E583B822E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510464002:0":{"text":"中には、俺自ら説得した者もいる……彼らに、お前たちを信じろと……魔法が、飢えと渇きから救ってくれると、俺が説得したのだ！","source_cn":"我甚至亲自说服了其中一些人，让他们信任你们！让他们相信...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49AC2AE455FB98F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510464003:0":{"text":"ホーリンを救おうと思ってやったことが、逆にホーリンを危機に陥れてしまったんだ……","source_cn":"我以为自己正在拯救呼临城，其实是在引敌入室……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B5B088E745E6713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510464004:0":{"text":"ペルセウス、悲しみに心を痛めている今のあなたに、私の言葉は届かないかもしれませんが……","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，悲恸和痛苦正在蚕食你敏锐的心灵……这些话，或...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4CA431D41C259F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510464005:0":{"text":"ですが、これは決して魔法協会が望んだことではありません。私たちは、適量の雨を降らせ、干ばつを改善できる魔法陣の実験を何度も行ってきました。","source_cn":"但是，这一切并非魔法师协会的意愿。我们反复实验过，发动...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07FC6856C6CD8481","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male